    "q": "What is the difference between product scope and project scope for Release 1?",
    "a": "Product scope is the features of the result: the de-identified ED and bed reports, the semantic model with RLS by site and the supported service. Project scope is all the work to deliver it, including the privacy impact assessment, data cleaning, testing, training and the support handover."
