   "modelAnswer": "Grain statement: FactBedCensus holds one row per inpatient unit per census date, taken from the midnight snapshot in the Bed Management System (A-006). Type: periodic snapshot. Rows: 643 (644 expected; ARH-SUR 2026-08-16 missing and reported). Keys: UnitID to DimUnit, CensusDate to DimDate. Numbers: StaffedBeds and OccupiedBeds (semi-additive, never summed across dates), ALCPatients (additive into patient-days). Flag: OverCapacityFlag."
