    "a": "One row per inpatient unit per census date, a midnight snapshot. Because the same beds appear every day, beds are semi-additive: add across units on one day but never across days. Occupancy is computed per day and averaged (87.0% average daily) or taken on the last date (84.0% on 2026-09-30)."
