    "Add at least four entries from evidence: Power BI access requests (16.7% within target, median 105.5 hours), missing-census alerting, refresh-failure alerting, and one lesson from the lessons-learned register.",
    "Apply the seven questions to your top entry, rank all entries by value against effort, and name an owner for each.",
