   "modelAnswer": "Knowledge article (example; KB-ACC-05 in the finished model covers MFA enrolment). Title: I cannot sign in to the CIS after enrolling in MFA. Symptoms: the sign-in prompt loops on a shared workstation. Cause: MFA registered on an old phone, or enrolment not finished. Resolution: the analyst verifies identity against the human resources (HR) record and, for a phone request, calls back the number held there, then resets the MFA registration and stays on the line while the clinician enrols again. Workaround: none; never use another person's session. Escalate: Identity and Access group if the reset fails. Owner: Grace Liu (E-005). Review: every six months and after any process or system change (proposed)."
