    "Add the recovery order (A-007; then A-012 and A-014; then A-008 and A-001; then A-002, A-003 and A-005; then tier 2 and tier 3) and state that both CIS restore tests failed, so downtime may be long.",
    "In the Incident and problem management workflow, draw the path from incident to problem, known error and change, and open problem records PRB-01 for recurring malware on A-008 and PRB-02 for repeat phishing on A-013.",
    "Compare all three with See the finished example, tick Done when, and answer Check yourself."
