   "modelAnswer": "| Record | What happened | Severity | Priority (proposed) | Handling |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| SEC-004 | Ransomware precursor, A-008, tier 1 | Critical | P1 | Major incident declared |\n| SEC-003 | Unauthorized access, CIS (A-001) | High | P2 | Health Information Act risk-of-harm assessment by Priya Raman (E-003) |\n| SEC-009 | Unauthorized access, A-007 | High (Critical if a privileged account was used) | P2 | Contained, not yet recovered; staff data, so a Protection of Privacy Act assessment |\n| SEC-006 | Misconfiguration, A-009, tier 3 | Medium | P3 | Check exposure of Confidential data |\n| SEC-010 | Phishing, A-013, single user | Low | P4 | Close with user advice |"
