  "purpose": "The programme brief is the one-page introduction to Project Beacon. It tells a newcomer what problem Beacon solves, what the three releases deliver, who is involved, how success is measured, what it costs and what could go wrong. You, the Programme Manager, write it in week 1, day 1 and refresh it whenever the numbers change. Dr. Helen Marchetti, the executive sponsor, approves it. Leaders, clinicians, vendors and new team members read it before their first Beacon meeting, and you reuse its wording in the business case, the charter and every status report.",
